      "comment": "Sybilla: The Meeting at the Silver Tree",
      "content": "Remus entered a forgotten city older than land, found the Irminsul and was greeted by golden bees. The voice that claimed to be the former envoy spoke of his future cities and subjects, the justice that would be Remuria's downfall, and offered to show the way up if he still wished to go. When he asked whether fate left room for choice, the hollow crumbled and the tree became a golden ship.",
