      "comment": "Sybilla: Phobos",
      "content": "Phobos is the Grand Symphony made from Sybilla's life and wisdom and Remus's power. It inherited her wish for human happiness but not a will, so it granted every wish, including cruel ones. Remus tried to destroy it, and in the end Boethius was consumed by it and the Traveler destroyed it.",
