      "keysecondary": [],
      "comment": "Sybilla: Angels and Heavenly Principles",
      "content": "The Angelos' Heptades text calls Sybilla the songstress who bathed the newborn Nicole in compassion alongside Nabu Malikata. The angels later rebelled against the Heavenly Principles; Koitar, the eldest, fell. The wiki ties Sybilla's work in Remuria to this rebellion; the text itself does not.",
